DINOv2 (facebookresearch/dinov2, Apache-2.0) at commit 7b187bd4df8efce2cbcbbb67bd01532c19bf4c9c needs Python >= 3.10
and PyTorch >= 2.0. This patch, used for the paper's DINOv2 ablation, makes it run on Python 3.9 and PyTorch 1.10:
type annotations without "X | None", no `antialias` argument for PyTorch < 1.11 (the model uses antialias=False), and
a plain attention implementation when F.scaled_dot_product_attention is missing. Apply with
  git clone https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2 && cd dinov2 && git checkout 7b187bd && git apply <this file>
and pass --dinov2_repo /path/to/dinov2.

diff --git a/dinov2/layers/attention.py b/dinov2/layers/attention.py
